{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:112","original":"Titular main character of [[Suzumiya Haruhi no Yuuutsu]]. A spunky, demanding teenage girl who loves mysteries and paranormal phenomena. \r\n\r\n[spoiler]Unbeknowst to Haruhi, she has the ability to alter the very fabric of reality itself to get whatever she wished for, including an encounter with [[Nagato Yuki|an alien]], a [[Asahina Mikuru|time traveller]], and an [[Koizumi Itsuki|esper]] who were sent to investigate her.[/spoiler]\r\n\r\nShe has [[brown eyes]] and a [[medium hair|medium-length]] [[brown hair|brown]] [[bob cut]], which she wears with an [[orange hairband]] and [[orange ribbon|orange]] [[hair ribbon|ribbons]]. Her most common outfit is a female [[Kita High School uniform]] (which is a [[serafuku]] consisting of a [[white shirt]], [[blue sailor collar]], [[red ribbon]], and a [[blue skirt]]) with [[black socks|black]] [[kneehighs]]. She also often wears a [[red armband]] to represent her status as [[SOS Brigade]] leader.\r\n\r\nShe is voiced by [[Hirano Aya]] in Japanese and [[Wendee Lee]] in English.\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #35003\r\n* !asset #28569770: [[Suzumiya Haruhi no Shoushitsu]]\r\n* !post #3157667: [[Suzumiya Haruhi no Shoushitsu]] ([[Kouyouen academy school uniform|Kouyouen]]) \r\n* !post #143764: [[Superheroine Haruhi]][br][[Suzumiya Haruhi no Tomadoi]]\r\n* !post #5260753: [[Suzumiya Haruhiko]] ([[genderswap|genderswapped]], male)\r\n* !post #2779115: [[Suzumiya Haruhi (young)|Young]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Kyon]]\r\n* [[Asahina Mikuru]]\r\n* [[Suzumiya Harubin]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"suzumiya_haruhi"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native